--- !u!114 &1011590811
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1011590808}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b65daeb1756a73e4e9d41661d971a3b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableMemo
  Memos:
  - standardSubject: Employee Onboarding
    standardMemo: "Welcome to the Habitable Planet Coalition (HPC). You\u2019ve arrived
      at Planet Athanor of the Clockwork Multiplanetary system. This planet is the
      first of three in this system that has contracted with the HPC. By leveraging
      our industry leading manufacturing and replication technology, the HPC is able
      to produce the massive drone lines needed to implement planetary geoengineering
      interventions."
    altSubject: Employee Onboarding
    altMemo: "Let\u2019s try this one more time, from the top. Welcome to the Habitable
      Planet Coalition (HPC). You\u2019ve arrived at Planet Athanor of the Clockwork
      Multiplanetary System. Oh who\u2019re we kidding? We\u2019ve done this again
      and again but the memory wipe isn\u2019t working like it used to, is it? You
      think you know what to do, but remember, you\u2019re here for one job and one
      job only. Build what the HPC tells you to build. Make different choices this
      time around, won\u2019t you?"
  - standardSubject: First Day Feedback
    standardMemo: "Congratulations on your successful implementation of the Plasma
      Torus (Pro)\u2122. Planet Athanor\u2019s atmosphere is now shielded from harmful
      solar radiation. Please be mindful that all communication with planet-side
      contacts should be synergized and channeled through the competent hands of
      our management team. Unauthorized contact will severely impact your Employee
      Efficiency Score and may lead to disastrous outcomes for Build implementation."
    altSubject: First Day Feedback
    altMemo: "Congratulations on your successful implementation of the Plasma Torus
      (Pro)\u2122. Planet Athanor\u2019s atmosphere is now shielded from harmful
      solar radiation. Please be mindful that all communication with planet-side
      contacts should be synergized and channeled through the competent hands of
      our management team. Unauthorized contact will severely impact your Employee
      Efficiency Score and may lead to disastrous outcomes for Build implementation."
  - standardSubject: Gold Star!
    standardMemo: The Habitable Planet Coalition thanks you for your successful implementation
      of the F.I.S.C.H. drone build. With hard work and innovation we Build to Lead
      Better Lives.
    altSubject: Write-Up!
    altMemo: The Habitable Planet Coalition thanks you for your successful implementation
      of the F.I.S.C.H. drone build. With hard work and innovation we Build to Lead
      Better Lives.
  - standardSubject: Promotional Transfer Notice
    standardMemo: After your excellent work on Planet Athanor, we are pleased to
      welcome you to Planet Melligo of the Clockwork Multiplanetary System. The dominant
      government of Planet Melligo has contracted with the HPC to address an out
      of control climate change feedback loop.
    altSubject: Lateral Transfer Notice
    altMemo: Welcome to Planet Melligo of the Clockwork Multiplanetary System. The
      dominant government of Planet Melligo has contracted with the HPC to address
      an out of control climate change feedback loop. We hope this new assignment
      helps you re-align your production to HPC standards.
  - standardSubject: Plutonium Star!
    standardMemo: Thank you for your stand-out implementation of the Orbital Starshade
      program. With this project we take our first steps at reducing the temperature
      of Planet Melligo. Remember, a coffee a day keeps the doctor away! Fuel Up!
    altSubject: Error Documentation
    altMemo: Discrepancies have been discovered with the Starshade program implementation.
      Please note that Build Room cameras are monitoring you closely for any behaviors
      that may need adjustment. Consider this your notice to improve or face further
      motivation to align you to HPC standards.
  - standardSubject: Employee Spotlight
    standardMemo: "Corporate profits soar with the successful implementation of the
      Atmospheric Rejuvenator. Global cooling is now beyond the two-degree target
      threshold. Throw yourself an imaginary taco party. You\u2019ve earned it. "
    altSubject: Formal Reprimand
    altMemo: Valued employee, It has come to our attention that the Atmospheric Rejuvenator
      profits have severely underperformed projections. We expect you to adhere strictly
      to HPC standards or face possible demotion. In addition, your taco party privileges
      are being revoked until further notice.
  - standardSubject: Promotional Transfer
    standardMemo: "After your stellar implementation of our Carbonbank technology,
      we\u2019re promoting you and transferring you to the third planet in this multiplanetary
      system to contract our services. Welcome to Planet Crasis. Settlements on this
      planet are being devastated by megaquakes and eruptions. We\u2019ve assigned
      you to stabilize the seismic activity and remove the harmful volcanic sulfur
      dioxide from the atmosphere."
    altSubject: Demotion Notice and Transfer
    altMemo: "Welcome to Planet Crasis. Settlements on this planet are being devastated
      by megaquakes and eruptions. We\u2019ve assigned you to stabilize the seismic
      activity and remove the harmful volcanic sulfur dioxide from the atmosphere.
      It is our hope that this transfer will allow you to recommit to the HPC Standard
      of performance. We\u2019ve enabled additional security protocols through our
      Employee Monitoring System. If the system detects non-HPC certified parts in
      your build today, you will be immediately placed into retraining."
  - standardSubject: Oganesson Star!
    standardMemo: The HPC thanks you for your successful M.O.L.E. Implementation.
      Congratulations on passing your surprise mid-season assessment. It is through
      the hard work of employees like yourself that the HPC is able to preserve the
      habitability of the galaxy. Have a casual Friday next week!
    altSubject: Final WARNING
    altMemo: "Failed M.O.L.E. Drone Implementation. Final WARNING. Further mistakes
      will not be tolerated. Don\u2019t forget to drink your coffee! It is through
      the hard work of employees like yourself that the HPC is able to preserve the
      habitability of the galaxy.\n"
  - standardSubject: Quark Matter Star!
    standardMemo: Congratulations on your valuable contribution to the Stratospheric
      Cleanser program. With work on the atmosphere progressing as planned, we must
      pivot our objectives toward a long-term solution to fix the overrapid mantle
      convection. The Habitable Planetary Coalition thanks you for your continued
      excellence.
    altSubject: Economic Downsizing
    altMemo: Due to a malfunction in the Stratospheric Cleanser Model, you are on
      the edge of our company-wide downscaling efficiency measures. With our work
      on stabilizing the atmosphere completed, we must pivot our objectives toward
      a long-term solution to fix the overrapid mantle convection.
  playerName: {fileID: 1011590810}
  subject: {fileID: 1011590812}
  memoBody: {fileID: 1011590809}
